WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.160
Now you can reflect a decent character. Most atheists are decent. Most people who

2
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.640
go to hell will be decent. When you keep nine out of ten commandments, surely

3
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:20.720
you're decent. But that's not the character of God, because there will be

4
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.160
people lost who will say to God, Lord, Lord, have we not prophesied in thy name, and

5
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.700
in thy name have cast out devils, and in thy name done many wonderful work? Those

6
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:38.020
are decent people lost. Without divine power, no one can reflect the character

7
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:47.780
of God, because the character of God is something divine. Having said all of that,

8
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:58.260
let's flip the coin. The Christian who has low standards does not need God.
